note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note Contract section 4 lines 114-116 and erratum E7: omc-site records in emission order, iter = the 0-based
note counters of the enclosing UNROLLED loops, outer to inner, joined by ".", or "-". Function mode; the only
note trap sites are the unsigned divs by the run-time divisor a (OMEGESE 9.3 trap 2): line 8 (-), line 11
note (copies 0.0 0.1 1.0 1.1), line 14 in a rolled loop inside unroll i (copies 0 1). Exact stderr exp/diag-site-nest.err.
om2 diag
fn f a ulong to ulong
s = div 7 a
for i ulong 2 unroll
for j ulong 2 unroll
s = add s div add i j a
end
for k ulong 2
s = add s div k a
end
end
ret s
end
